{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1003_405bcp", "source_sha256": "2f141fc23a96910a4ec2ed78e6d2f4e36027c536e213a2d0feb1b0ef04f07091", "ja": "志保。リハーサル中だったんじゃ……\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "志保。你不是正在彩排吗……\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "5fff23209aa74ae0ed32a28f0f11e48f971d70f957f0c9a8a36fc6e21a0b7e13", "ja": "プロデューサーさん、お疲れ様です。\nいえ、今は、その……。", "zh": "制作人，辛苦了。\n没什么，只是现在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1005_405bcp", "source_sha256": "135be56f946f1c5c25abdd4e2e847c6b6c38643d7a4a31eb694b08984855c971", "ja": "ああ、休憩でお茶を淹れてたのか。\n紅茶と……へえ、レモンまで？", "zh": "啊，原来你是在休息时泡茶啊。\n红茶和……哦，连柠檬都有？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "f9cd91b1ad158891bf05af0282040858f12ce0d0d485297995747142b398163d", "ja": "の、喉にいいと聞いたので。\n私、リーダーですし、これくらい当然です。", "zh": "听、听说对嗓子有好处。\n而且我是队长，这点小事是应该的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1007_405bcp", "source_sha256": "c505dffa234442af8a98e9e904f43a8c60340454df03ac557fbd426cdf946cf4", "ja": "そうか……。\n他にも、なんか袋があるみたいだな？", "zh": "这样啊……好像还有别的袋子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "966926973fe2f15ce38c17cad60fc31c094a01289b4120523f3961411ecc37f8", "ja": "……ビスケットです。\nたまたま家にあったので……、少しですけど。", "zh": "……是饼干。\n正好家里有，就带了一点……虽然不多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1009_405bcp", "source_sha256": "0261c5bd53dc672d28fc20777ace2b23d0c20eec5cfb16ea71fb019b54bed95c", "ja": "へえ。それにしても、かわいい袋だな。\nプレゼントみたいな……。", "zh": "哦。不过话说回来，这袋子真可爱啊。\n看起来就像礼物一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "341edd461b47bb8d5737dce1f739f8420e68f6bd4eeaa43206b581c2f8be5977", "ja": "は、母が！　用意してくれたんです。\nたまたま余ってて、……せっかくだから、って。", "zh": "是、是妈妈！特意帮我准备的。\n正好有多余的……难得有这个机会，就……大小规律", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1011_405bcp", "source_sha256": "327acc54102a1b34b72dec863ee4142e9d5551ce460b1175e2c12464174c126e", "ja": "……、そうか。ありがたいな。\n今度オレからもお礼を言わないと。", "zh": "……这样啊。真是帮大忙了。\n下次我也得亲自道谢才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "72334f2330b3216feae679c4ab56d891ccaae075794cfedbe5923eb83c304348", "ja": "大丈夫です！　大したことじゃないので、\n気にしないでください。……本当に。", "zh": "没关系的！这算不上什么大事，\n请您别放在心上。……真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "433daad93ef9d33ae1826da7cf0b80f7c59bd3eb8c420df4fb3516ca66e34353", "ja": "……可奈にも、星梨花にも海美さんにも。私、\n迷惑かけてばかりなので……たまには、これくらい。", "zh": "……对可奈、星梨花还有海美姐，我都\n一直添麻烦……偶尔这样一回，也是应该的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1014_405bcp", "source_sha256": "c109c477e295813148d132a5518a9ac036caff86978f5a5964a2492c106bee1c", "ja": "そうか？\nま、それじゃ、気にしないでおくよ。", "zh": "是吗？\n那好吧，我就不放在心上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1015_405bcp", "source_sha256": "49d096558ef8089b4c64d72c1e9b678b2a822a0db66c49b43191fbe31cb790bf", "ja": "……喜んでもらえるといいな。", "zh": "……希望你能喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "87df9c82735d04834bc4b06b9785068f9be8101f8fffc7493d9240879e5ad9a4", "ja": "……。はい。", "zh": "……。好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "e90c706029440b663ff9243f33dba2c3b3cd7721036da61f426d2bb7939d335c", "ja": "あ、でももう時間……それじゃ失礼します。\nあの、荷物、そのままにしておいてくださいね！", "zh": "啊，不过已经到时间了……那我先告辞了。\n那个，行李请就那样放着哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1018_se", "source_sha256": "dcf0d7f4922941afaf124937bfcfce678cd2075f25517ce1d44b5d1b0a813b6a", "ja": "ガチャ……パタン", "zh": "咔哒……啪嗒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0493_1019_405bcp", "source_sha256": "0766ef1441dccfbf11529fee7e7b8c5b0f79202f68ffa943b32320daa03548bc", "ja": "（……ビスケットの表面には、何か字が書いてある。\nあり、が……と……）", "zh": "（……饼干的表面，好像写着什么字。\n谢、谢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
